    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "3C9F1C86B3D9A181",
      "text": "Bienvenue à l’Arène de Frigao !\\c\\nAvez-vous besoin que je vous explique à nouveau\\nen quoi consiste l’examen de l’Arène ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "3C9F1986B3D99C68",
      "text": "Pour affronter Laïm, vous devrez d’abord\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]ouvrir son concert[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].\\c\\nEn d’autres termes, vous serez sa première\\npartie !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "3C9F1A86B3D99E1B",
      "text": "Avant le show de la Championne, vous chaufferez\\nle public en combattant des Pokémon.\\c\\nOffrez-lui un concert « spectraculaire » !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "3C9F1F86B3D9A69A",
      "text": "Parlez au présentateur devant la scène pour\\ncommencer l’examen de l’Arène.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_01",
      "hash64": "75CFDD5A7E891CA8",
      "text": "Yo, te voilà !\\nC’est toi qui fais la première partie, c’est ça ?\\c\\nOn m’appelle MC Kilpatron ! Si tu veux\\nmonter sur scène, c’est ici que ça s’passe ![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 151,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_02",
      "hash64": "75CFE05A7E8921C1",
      "text": "Le deal est simple : tu vas faire un Combat Duo\\npour le public. En gros, tu vas utiliser deux\\r\\nPokémon en même temps.[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_03",
      "hash64": "75CFDF5A7E89200E",
      "text": "[EMPTY 55]",
      "flags": 0,
